<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "The Conversations sidebar is the left IRC navigation pane: joined channels ordered by recent activity, recent PMs, auto-join channels, and popular channel suggestions."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_group_tools}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Header")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "The header shows the title, a close button, and compact counters for open channels, recent PMs, and auto-join entries. You can also toggle the panel via the toolbar."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_group_view}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Sections")}</.help_h4>
<p>{dgettext("help_ui", "Collapsible sections with clickable headers:")}</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("help_ui", "OPEN CHANNELS")}</strong> {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "- Channels you are currently joined to, ordered by recent activity, with user counts, unread badges, and highlight markers"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("help_ui", "RECENT PRIVATE MESSAGES")}</strong> {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "- PM conversations restored from the current session or account history"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("help_ui", "AUTO-JOIN")}</strong> {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "- Saved channels that will be joined automatically on connect"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>{dgettext("help_ui", "POPULAR CHANNELS")}</strong>
    {dgettext(
      "help_ui",
      "- Active public channels you have not joined yet, plus a button that opens the full channel list"
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_star}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Features")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Click a channel or PM to switch to it. Open channel rows keep unread badges and highlight markers in one place; unread rows appear"
  )} <strong>bold</strong>{dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    ". Rows with highlights"
  )} <strong>flash</strong>{dgettext("help_ui", ". User counts appear next to all channels.")}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_channel}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Open Channels")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "The active channel is highlighted in the Open Channels section. New channel activity moves that channel toward the top without changing the tab order. Closing a channel tab leaves the channel, so joined channels and channel tabs stay aligned."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_dialog_autojoin}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Auto-Join")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Auto-Join shows saved channels from your account auto-join list. Channels with saved keys show only a +key marker; the key itself is not displayed in the sidebar."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_star}>{dgettext("help_ui", "Popular Channels")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Shows active public channels you have not joined yet when the server has rooms to suggest. Click [+] to join a suggestion, or click \"Browse All Channels...\" to open the full channel list dialog."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_ui", "User Interactions")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_ui",
    "Right-click a channel or PM row for context actions. Double-click a PM row to open or focus that private message tab."
  )}
</p>
